<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metal Management started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metal Management started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Michelle Applebaum started coverage of Metal Management Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Said Metal Management is &quot;the fastest growing company in the rapidly consolidating scrap industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Estimates earnings at $0.17 per share in 1997 and $0.95 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set price target at $27 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 20-3/8.</p>
</text>
